WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.375 --> 00:00:02.208
Ugh!

00:00:02.292 --> 00:00:04.792
A pixel art level.
This is getting ridiculous.

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:07.042
How am I supposed to use
8-bit powers?

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:09.333
Yeah you’re having trouble
figuring out any of your powers.

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:10.292
[growls]

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:11.375
Change of subject.

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:12.667
What’s going on
with this level?

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.417
Wow, Jimmy really sucks
at gardening.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.625
Yeah it’s rotten.

00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:17.417
It’s the work of the Shroud.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.000
But it’s something different,
something new…

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.292
Look at little Pixel Guy!

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.500
Something's got him spooked!

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:24.500
Not again!

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:26.333
Are those swarms?
What’s wrong with them?

00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.542
Usually they’re so sweet and…
cuddly.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:30.500
[Gorilla] Yeah, they look
extra-bitey.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.792
It must be that rot.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:34.125
They’re like zombie swarms.
No wait-- Swarmbies!

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.333
Ooh, that’s good. Yeah, Swarmbies.
They’re called Swarmbies now.

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:37.542
Swarmbies, huh?

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.458
Don’t forget that’s mine.

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:40.083
Cute and terrifying.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.833
Flesh! Must feast!

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:43.792
-Kill, kill, bitter, kill, feed.
-They’re coming! Run!

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.167
[zombie swarm noises]

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.125
Maybe we don’t have to run,
but we should still get out of here.

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:51.917
Invaders! Must kill!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.708
A plant zombie? Zom-plant? Plant-bie?
Got nothing for that.

00:00:55.792 --> 00:00:57.375
Kill!

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:00.750
Banana blaster!

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:01.875
Ah damn it.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:03.792
Ew!

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.125
Did his arm just come off?

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:07.000
God!

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.417
I get it. It’s bad timing,

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.292
but this reminds me,
we've not have lunch.

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:11.708
Uh oh, here he comes again.

00:01:11.792 --> 00:01:13.375
[groaning]

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:15.333
He’s unconscious.

00:01:15.417 --> 00:01:17.625
Give him a little orange juice.
Sometimes that helps.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.000
Maybe we could try putting him
in a Fusion Chamber?

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.167
That makes way more sense.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.000
Gorilla, take care of the zombies.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.542
-Swarmbies!
-Swarmbies.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:25.750
Just feels good to say.

00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:29.083
While me and Banana get Weedman
into the hybrid pod thingy.

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:30.833
Oh great, yeah.
Fight an un-dead army.

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:31.875
The easy job.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.083
And I’ll grab his bits and pieces. Wait a sec…

00:01:34.542 --> 00:01:35.625
[gags]

00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:37.292
Eat! Food!

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:38.375
Feastables!

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:41.458
Oh man, this won’t be easy
with those cute little voices.

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.792
Run! Run!

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:45.958
Oops! Sorry!

00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:48.542
[gags]

00:01:48.792 --> 00:01:50.542
Oh god!
Why do you do this?

00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:51.375
What are you doing?

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:53.375
[cries]

00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:54.792
-[Panthar] Gorilla!
-Coming!

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:55.917
I did my best, guys.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.125
But the Swarmbies
are still swarmb-ing.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.292
Yeah, it doesn’t work when you do it.

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.875
Hurry up,
and get that thing going!

00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:02.417
Damn it. No Pandemonium Particles.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.417
What do we do now?

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.667
Banana, we saw you picked some up
on the last level.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:07.875
You’re hiding the PP in your pants.

00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:08.708
Fine.

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:12.042
Man, I was gonna use these
to make some cool powers for myself.

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:13.958
Some day…

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:18.125
I’m the creator of life.

00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:20.375
I wonder if I’ll know when to stop.

00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:23.042
Will I make something one day
even I won’t understand?

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.333
[distant growling]

00:02:25.417 --> 00:02:26.708
Banana, hurry!

00:02:26.792 --> 00:02:28.042
Hey, I’m going as fast as I can.

00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:30.208
I’m trying to do a really good job
so there’s no notes--

00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:31.958
[explosion]

00:02:33.292 --> 00:02:34.792
Ah! Thank you my friends.

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:35.958
You saved us!

00:02:36.042 --> 00:02:36.958
Ya welcome!

00:02:37.042 --> 00:02:38.250
[gnawing]

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:42.083
These new tentacle legs
give me the power to heal.

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:45.292
And as thanks,
I will give you the power as well.

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:47.417
Oh great. Another power
he won’t be able to figure out.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.875
Shut up. Thank you.

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.250
We will stay behind
and heal our friends.

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:53.500
If you find this source of the rot,

00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:55.625
I believe you will find
what you’re looking for.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:59.125
Sounds like this Jimmy fetch quest
just got a side mission.

00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:01.042
Side mission?
They’re just a waste of time.

00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:02.375
Nobody likes side missions.

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:03.292
[Banana] No one likes you.

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:05.875
-Ah! Come to me my Swarmbies.
-[Banana] That’s my joke!

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:07.625
I will heal you.
That kinda tickles.

00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:09.375
That’s real biting!
Stop biting! You’re biting!

